   - Otherwise it returns the decoded claims dict in [auth/jwt.py](/Users/basethesis/Desktop/benchmark_hermes-fabric/prereqs%202/fixtures/task01_explain_jwt/auth/jwt.py:35).

3. `refresh(refresh_token)`
   - Decodes the supplied refresh token with the same `SECRET` and `[ALGO]` in [auth/jwt.py](/Users/basethesis/Desktop/benchmark_hermes-fabric/prereqs%202/fixtures/task01_explain_jwt/auth/jwt.py:41).
